---
---
<div class="card card--experience" id="experience-full">
  <span class="eyebrow">WORK HISTORY</span>
  <h3>Experience</h3>
  <div class="timeline">
    <div class="timeline-item">
      <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
      <div class="timeline-body">
        <div class="timeline-header">
          <div>
            <p class="timeline-role">Lead Software Engineer</p>
            <p class="timeline-company">EPAM Systems</p>
          </div>
          <span class="timeline-period">Oct 2024 – Present</span>
        </div>
        <p class="timeline-desc">
          Leading front-end engineering efforts, driving architecture decisions and mentoring team members on scalable Angular patterns.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="timeline-item">
      <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
      <div class="timeline-body">
        <div class="timeline-header">
          <div>
            <p class="timeline-role">Senior Consultant</p>
            <p class="timeline-company">HCL Technologies</p>
          </div>
          <span class="timeline-period">Oct 2021 – Oct 2024</span>
        </div>
        <p class="timeline-desc">
          Led a 15-member team rebuilding a physician referral booking app (AngularJS → Angular 11).
          Implemented NGXS state management and Cypress E2E tests. Personally closed 60 defects vs team avg of 10–15, earning client recognition.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="timeline-item">
      <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
      <div class="timeline-body">
        <div class="timeline-header">
          <div>
            <p class="timeline-role">Senior Front End Developer</p>
            <p class="timeline-company">Nekkanti Systems Pvt. Ltd.</p>
          </div>
          <span class="timeline-period">Aug 2016 – Oct 2021</span>
        </div>
        <p class="timeline-desc">
          Rebuilt project from scratch (Angular 6 → Angular 12) with a custom Webpack builder.
          Built a reusable component library, Route Guards, auth token interceptor, and product showcase sites.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .timeline {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .timeline-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .timeline-dot {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent);
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.4);
  }

  :global([data-theme="light"]) .timeline-dot {
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0, 151, 178, 0.4);
  }

  .timeline-body { flex: 1; }

  .timeline-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .timeline-role {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .timeline-company {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-top: 0.15rem;
  }

  .timeline-period {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    white-space: nowrap;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .timeline-desc {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--muted-text);
  }
</style>
